# Representative libdrm parent/child records, deliberately out of key order.
1.0.0
1586, C1, Shared GPU name
	1028, 0002, Board "two" μ
	1028, 0001, Shared GPU name
	1028, 0002, Shadowed board name
1586, C2, Second revision
	1028, 0002, Other board
1586, C1, Shadowed device name
	1028, 0003, Child of shadowed device
0000, 00, First device
FFFF, FF, Last device
